(The proposed acquisition of Option Care Health, Inc. \('Company'\) by Onyx Bidco LLC \('Parent'\) involves Clayton, Dubilier) Tj
T* (& Rice Fund XII, L.P. \('CD&R'\) and McKesson Corporation \('McKesson'\) as equity co-investors delivering executed Equity) Tj
T* (Commitment Letters aggregating $2,873,295,853, alongside a committed funded term debt facility of $3.15 billion and a) Tj
T* ($500.0 million revolving credit facility. Form 8-K expressly confirms that closing is not conditioned upon the receipt of) Tj
T* (financing. Option Care Health holds express third-party beneficiary status under the Equity Commitment Letters,) Tj
T* (providing standing to compel specific performance to fund equity upon satisfaction of closing conditions. However, from a) Tj
T* (governance and structural topology perspective, several friction points emerge. CD&R Fund XII and McKesson provided) Tj
T* (Limited Guarantees guaranteeing Parent's obligation to pay the $291,927,951 Parent Termination Fee \(and enforcement) Tj
T* (expenses capped at $7.5 million in the aggregate\), but these guarantees are entered into severally and not jointly. The) Tj
T* (merger agreement does not disclose the specific numerical allocation of equity commitments or several liability) Tj
T* (proportions between CD&R and McKesson. Additionally, specific performance and the Parent Termination Fee are) Tj
T* (mutually exclusive remedies under Delaware law: if the Company elects to collect the termination fee, closing specific) Tj
T* (performance is extinguished. Regulatory risk allocation distinguishes between HSR Act clearance \('reasonable best) Tj
T* (efforts'\) and specified healthcare filings / State Boards of Pharmacy authorizations \(where Parent is held to a unilateral) Tj
T* ('best efforts' standard\). Given that McKesson is a primary distributor and strategic giant in pharmaceutical supply chains,) Tj
T* (and Option Care Health purchased 68% of its supplies from four wholesale distributors in 2025, vertical integration and) Tj
T* (regulatory agency inquiries under antitrust and healthcare licensing frameworks pose structural timing hurdles prior to the) Tj
T* (October 5, 2027 drop-dead Termination Date.) Tj
