(RISK: None | NOTES: All core factual statements cross-referenced with primary SEC documentation: \(1\) Merger Agreement date of October 5, 2026, Onyx Bidco LLC, Onyx Merger Sub, and CD&R / McKesson Investor Group confirmed via Form 8-K Item 1.01; \(2\) Closing is explicitly not conditioned on financing; \(3\) Equity commitment letters total $2,873,295,853 with express third-party beneficiary rights for the Company; \(4\) Debt commitment letter provides up to $3.15B term debt and up to $500.0M revolving credit commitments; \(5\) Limited guarantees backing the $291,927,951 Parent Termination Fee and capped expenses of $7.5M are several and not joint; \(6\) Per share consideration of $32.05 cash; \(7\) Schedule 14A confirms Option Care Health will remain a separate company led by its own management team post-closing; \(8\) HSR Act reasonable best efforts standard and Parent best efforts standard for specified healthcare filings confirmed; \(9\) Outside termination date of October 5, 2027 at 11:59 p.m. Eastern/NYC time confirmed; \(10\) Operational footprint of 86 full-service pharmacies and 187 ambulatory infusion suites across 43 states confirmed in Form 10-Q \(June 30, 2026\); \(11\) Supplier concentration \(68% across four vendors in 2025; 57% across three vendors in H1 2026\) confirmed in 2025 Form 10-K and Q2 2026 Form 10-Q; \(12\) Balance sheet debt figures \($672.9M First Lien Term Loan principal and $500.0M Senior Notes as of June 30, 2026\) confirmed.) Tj
