(The Seller asserts that the $2,873,295,853 equity financing package and regulatory covenants render transaction) Tj
T* (execution fully insulated. However, a forensic audit of the control topology, syndicate governance, and regulatory efforts) Tj
T* (mechanisms contradicts this position. First, user parameters confirm that McKesson is delivering a $1.4B minority) Tj
T* (co-investment. Against aggregate sponsor equity commitments of $2,873,295,853, McKesson accounts for 48.725%) Tj
T* (\($1,400,000,000 / $2,873,295,853\), while CD&R Fund XII accounts for 51.275% \($1,473,295,853\). This near-equal equity) Tj
T* (concentration creates substantial control topology ambiguity. The public record \(Form 8-K Item 1.01\) does not disclose) Tj
T* (the Onyx Bidco LLC limited liability company agreement, Class B or common voting units, board designation quotas, or) Tj
T* (dispositive veto mechanics. Under corporate governance standards, an unfiled governance pact or negative control) Tj
T* (mechanism could trigger rebuttable presumptions of control or Section 13\(d\) group formation requiring securities law) Tj
T* (disclosures and state regulatory filings. Second, this control concentration directly interfaces with an asymmetric) Tj
T* (regulatory efforts regime. Under the Merger Agreement, antitrust clearance under the HSR Act is governed solely by a) Tj
T* ('reasonable best efforts' standard, whereas Parent is bound by a heightened 'best efforts' obligation strictly for specified) Tj
T* (healthcare filings and State Boards of Pharmacy authorizations. Target SEC disclosures \(2025 Form 10-K and Q2 2026) Tj
T* (Form 10-Q\) establish extreme upstream wholesale distributor concentration: Option Care Health purchased 68% of its) Tj
T* (supplies from four distributors in 2025 and 57% from three distributors in H1 2026. Because McKesson is one of the) Tj
T* (nation's dominant pharmaceutical wholesale distributors, combining McKesson's supply operations with Option Care) Tj
T* (Health's downstream provider network \(86 pharmacies and 187 ambulatory infusion suites across 43 states\) introduces) Tj
T* (material FTC/DOJ vertical foreclosure scrutiny. Under a 'reasonable best efforts' standard, the Buyer Consortium is not) Tj
T* (contractually obligated to accept structural divestitures, distribution unbundling, or behavioral firewalls that exceed) Tj
T* (customary reasonable limits. Third, the Limited Guarantees supporting the $291,927,951 Parent Termination Fee \(and) Tj
T* (enforcement expenses capped at $7.5M\) are strictly several and not joint. Public disclosures omit the specific numerical) Tj
T* (allocation of several liability percentages between CD&R Fund XII and McKesson. Under Delaware contract law, several) Tj
T* (liability establishes non-fungible obligations: in the event of an uncured funding default or repudiation by either sponsor,) Tj
T* (the non-defaulting co-investor has no legal obligation to cure the shortfall. While Option Care Health holds third-party) Tj
T* (beneficiary rights to pursue specific performance of the equity commitments, this equitable remedy is mutually exclusive) Tj
T* (with the recovery of the Parent Termination Fee and cannot cure an antitrust impasse under a 'reasonable best efforts') Tj
T* (standard prior to the October 5, 2027 outside termination date.) Tj
